de?p=1438077#post1438077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Some intresting thing to add in regards to these paragraph. The killing of first nation people by colonists was unintentional, at least for the most part. When the colonists arived, they inintentionally brought bacteria and diseades that the natives did not have imunity for, therefore, most of them died of disease. If their predicesors would have bred with the vikings instead of killing them on sight, they would have gained imunity needed for their Civilization to survive. We also have to keep in mind that the conflict beetween Natives and non-natives was more nuanced than it is portrayed today. First nations people were and are human, which means that they are fallible and they are capable of the cruelty, savegry and degenaracy as seen in european society. Natives waged war on other natives before the colonists came, and when the colonists came, they came, they waged war on them. In other words, the fist nation people of yesteryear were not universally nobal savages, some of them (one tribe in particular) were canibal, and some of them did not live in harmony with nature, killing buffallo en mass. This is not to say that colonists were innocent, Wounded Knee was unjustifiable, and they did force any natives they integrated to convert into Christianity or else, but all in all, the wild west situation, as I previously said, was more nuanced than &quot;Whitey bad, Native Good&quot;. Forgive me for going off topic, but I had to set the record straight.</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>We don't need a discussion of how the genocide of First Nations people was nuanced.</b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-05-2021, 08:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T05:30:42-08:00","id":1438109,"title":"","content":"Yeah, there's absolutely no reason to go further into real-life atrocities to continue the discussion. I said what I did for what I believed was necessary context and nothing more -- that those who engineer and execute atrocities don't do it because they understand or perceive it to be evil. Rather, they do it because they perceive it to be <i>right</i>, or at least justified; or, as Arendt made the case in <i>Eichmann in Jerusalem</i>, by those who think nothing of it at all. And in some cases, as an outlash part and parcel of cyclical violence.<br /> <br /> To a certain extent, this mirrors itself well in WoD's morality system, as the mechanic represents a slippery, entropic, slope towards casual inhumanity. Low-Humanity vampires rarely envision or rationalize themselves objectively as creatures of unrepentant embrace of &quot;evil&quot;; that's the purview of select Paths, that only do so by way of contrast to Humanity, and even then in the context of some intellectual framework which rationalizes evil as necessary means to desired ends. Even the Sabbat's twisted moralities cannot exist separate from Humanity nor outside the context of Humanity; an antithesis cannot exist without a thesis.<br /> <br /> How is this relevant to whatever the Second Inquisition is, whatever it does, and what its ends may be? <i>Because</i> they believe what they're doing is right, and that the ends justify the means. Spoiler alert, this <i>doesn't</i> end with the eradication of inhumane vampires, a restoration of some arbitrary bureaucratic status quo, and a farewell to arms.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T08:02:41-08:00","id":1438122,"title":"","content":"Yes, we should always remember that corrupt, insane, torture-porn happy Inquisitors make better stories than the actual -we'll give you three months notice and we hope you'll confess to wrongdoings on your conscience or we'll let you go short of any compelling evidence- real inquisition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T10:33:23-08:00","id":1438139,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438122#post1438122\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, we should always remember that corrupt, insane, torture-porn happy Inquisitors make better stories than the actual -we'll give you three months notice and we hope you'll confess to wrongdoings on your conscience or we'll let you go short of any compelling evidence- real inquisition.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, all the burning alive, misogynist, anti-Semitic, psycho torture Inquisitors did exist.<br /> <br /> It was just the SPANISH Inquisition.<br /> <br /> Which is its own thing.<br /> <br /> It also gets conflated with the mass murder of innocents in Europe under the &quot;witch craze&quot; that was carried out by PROTESTANTS in the Renaissance Era. The Catholic Church having it as a doctrine of faith that witches weren't real.<br /> <br /> Which is kind of ironic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-05T16:20:33-08:00","id":1438196,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438139#post1438139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To be fair, all the burning alive, misogynist, anti-Semitic, psycho torture Inquisitors did exist.<br /> <br /> It was just the SPANISH Inquisition.<br /> <br /> Which is its own thing.<br /> <br /> It also gets conflated with the mass murder of innocents in Europe under the &quot;witch craze&quot; that was carried out by PROTESTANTS in the Renaissance Era. The Catholic Church having it as a doctrine of faith that witches weren't real.<br /> <br /> Which is kind of ironic.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ironic... and very annoying for those of us Catholics who'd like to see a legit Catholic hunter organization presented in media somewhere. Because &quot;fanatical evil Catholics who are worse than the monsters if they aren't actually in league with the Devil and the Pope is the Antichrist&quot; gets old after the first hundred or so times you see it in media.<br /> <br /> The &quot;Black Legend&quot; was pretty much invented by various Protestants publishers (Jack Chick's spiritual ancestors) as agitprop against Catholics... even as their brethren were burning people at the stake for imaginary witchcraft.<br /> <br /> Which is yet another reason why I've set my mind upon presenting a proper Catholic Inquisition for my campaign vs. the same old &quot;Evil Fanatic Catholics&quot; screed. I might even run with the idea that the secrets of Golconda (since the Book of Nod describes it as a literal gift from God offering salvation to vampires) didn't reside in esoteric Eastern teachings from Saulot, but are actually possessed by the Catholic Inquisition (perhaps even hidden in plain sight within the ascetic practices of a particular religious order) to offer repentant vampires a shot at salvation. Maybe even connect it with the old 1e Hunter's Hunted element where a Catholic priest with True Faith could actually transform wine into the blood of Christ and allow vampires of sufficient humanity/faith to receive nourishment from consuming it at Mass.<br /> <br /> There'd definitely be restrictions on achieving this... there's probably not more than a handful of priests who can pull off that particular miracle and without managing Golconda to reduce the blood needed would never be able to keep up with the demand. So I'm thinking its something for a campaign endpoint... like, if you're sufficiently humane and can manage the process of Golconda then the Inquisition has a hidden monastery somewhere where they bring vampires who've managed it and they basically live out their unlives as monks/nuns in this place receiving nourishment from the blood of Christ until the Second Coming.<br /> <br /> Basically, it can be the end point for a particularly penitent vampire's story (not much adventure potential once you've attained it).<br /> <br /> I think such a more unfanatical Catholic Inquisition would, in line with its real world counterpart, spend a lot more time gathering intelligence and if it can be proven that a vampire is basically the &quot;friendly neighborhood&quot; variety; only takes blood consensually (or via bags not obtained through theft or from animals), doesn't kill or frenzy, doesn't employ domination or similar harmful disciplines, etc. they get spared (albeit continually watched) because, if you're not committing crimes to obtain the blood you need to survive, then you're no more evil than the Red Cross and killing them would be a sin (and you can't fight sin with more sin).<br /> <br /> If they fail those standards, but aren't an immediate threat then they turn to capture (i.e. the stake/lethal damage to put them into torpor not fire/sunlight) so that they can be offered a chance to repent or be tried and sentenced to torpor (with periodic wakeups to see if they've changed their mind on repenting). Only those who are an immediate threat get put down using fire and/or sunlight as an act of defense of others.<br /> <br /> I'm still hashing out procedures and organization for this variant, but I really DO want a non-fanatical Catholic group for my own sake as much as anything. Also, Vampire Monastery and the prison where all the vampires kept in torpor are sound atmospheric as heck if the story turns in a direction where get to be seen (plus, plot elements like a vampire trying to track down the prison to free another vampire from torpor there). Heck, my next campaign might even be where everyone is playing a member after introducing it in this campaign (then the PCs would get to visit both periodically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T04:38:34-08:00","id":1438289,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438139#post1438139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> To be fair, all the burning alive, misogynist, anti-Semitic, psycho torture Inquisitors did exist.<br /> <br /> It was just the SPANISH Inquisition.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ignorance. Spend at least five minutes on wikipedia before you spout such ridiculous assertions based from pop-culture.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;According to modern estimates, around 150,000 were prosecuted for various offenses during the three-century duration of the Spanish Inquisition, out of which between 3,000 and 5,000 were executed (~2.7% of all cases).&quot;<br /> <br /> Torture for a confesssion was used once guilt had been established through investigation. For example in finding false-converts (Note that the inquisition here isn't hunting Jews but Jews pretending to be Catholics for tax reasons.) the inquisition would first find witnesses and watch the suspect for signs that they were false converts (buying meat from a suspect butcher, absense of chimney smoke on sunday, buying vegetables before passover). Once sufficient evidence was found, torture may begin if the subject doesn't confess immediately. </span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&quot;The Inquisition had jurisdiction only over Christians. It had no power to investigate, prosecute, or convict Jews, Muslims, or any open member of other religions. Anyone who was known to identify as either Jew or Muslim was outside of Inquisitorial jurisdiction and could be tried only by the King. All the inquisition could do in some of those cases was to deport the individual according to the King's law, but usually, even that had to go through a civil tribunal. The Inquisition had the authority to try only those who self-identified as Christians (initially for taxation purposes, later to avoid deportation as well) while practicing another religion de facto. Even those were treated as Christians. If they confessed or identified not as &quot;judeizantes&quot; but as fully practicing Jews, they fell back into the previously explained category and could not be targeted, although they would have pleaded guilty to previously lying about being Christian&quot;<br /> (Protestants would be considered heretical christians, but the spanish had few of them)<br /> <br /> The spanish never had a big witch problem and the inquisition didn't believe in that superstitious nonsense; sorcery was a state issue, not a church one.<br /> The spanish inquisition did burn &quot;sodomites&quot; , and that's pretty bad, yeah, but for the time period... I don't think that's worth getting into. The Spanish Inquisition did do some things very good though; they were leading prosecutors in cases of rape, human traficking and child abuse, which more secular spanish instituitions didn't bother with. The SI covered a lot of secular topics, they weren't just religious fantatics (Though, at the time, religious matters and secular matters were kinda seen as the same thing. For example giving arguments against common catholic beliefs and swindling are both considered the same crime because you're seen as 'misleading' people) and much of the executions would have been from these more serious, secular offenses. <br /> <br /> And yeah, the notice period and such I mentioned earlier applies to the Spanish inquisition. Honestly, after reading about them for a bit. I'm quite impressed. I might not agree with catholics, but it seems like they were trying to do what was best for people around them with their understanding of the world. With all that under consideration, why wouldn't the Second Inquisition be trying to better the world with their vampire hunts? </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 03-06-2021, 07:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T05:30:01-08:00","id":1438295,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438289#post1438289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ignorance. Spend at least five minutes on wikipedia before you spout such ridiculous assertions based from pop-culture.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given the Spanish Inquisition persecuted on racial lines of those who had been converted by force to Christianity after already bamishing religious minorities, using raw numbers misses the actual evil of the institution. Also, the death of 2000 people undere Torquemada the Grand Inquisitor is small potatoes compared to, say, Hitler but as a fanatical murderer of people he believed were &quot;insincere&quot; Christians, it was a nightmarish and vile man.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/tomas-de-torquemada\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/torquemada-isabella-ferdinand-painting.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/tomas-de-torquemada\" target=\"_blank\"> Friar and Fury &mdash; The Unfathomable Cruelty Of Tomas De Torquemada </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/tomas-de-torquemada\" target=\"_blank\"> https://allthatsinteresting.com/tomas-de-torquemada </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Tom&aacute;s de Torquemada was responsible for over 2000 deaths during the Spanish Inquisition, all in the name of keeping Christianity alive in Spain. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The definition of torture on Wikipedia also excludes waterboarding as torture, imprisonment, psychological torture, and the whole....burning people alive thing.<br /> <br /> It also overlooks the expulsion of 40K people from their homes.<br /> <br /> Your numbers talk about it being done over a century but the vast amount of horrors done by the organization were done during his fifteen year reign as Grand Inquisitor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-06-2021, 09:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T06:24:09-08:00","id":1438301,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438295#post1438295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/tomas-de-torquemada\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/wordpress/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/torquemada-isabella-ferdinand-painting.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/tomas-de-torquemada\" target=\"_blank\"> Friar and Fury &mdash; The Unfathomable Cruelty Of Tomas De Torquemada </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://allthatsinteresting.com/tomas-de-torquemada\" target=\"_blank\"> https://allthatsinteresting.com/tomas-de-torquemada </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Tom&aacute;s de Torquemada was responsible for over 2000 deaths during the Spanish Inquisition, all in the name of keeping Christianity alive in Spain. </div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Is it wrong of me that after that refresher I now want write up Torquemada as a Lasombra elder sired right about the time the Sabbat was getting off the ground and is the unexpected head of the Sabbat Inquisition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T06:32:18-08:00","id":1438302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438301#post1438301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it wrong of me that after that refresher I now want write up Torquemada as a Lasombra elder sired right about the time the Sabbat was getting off the ground and is the unexpected head of the Sabbat Inquisition?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have the 100 year rule. It's not wrong to make supernatural creatures out of political and social figures from a 100+ years ago.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T07:03:00-08:00","id":1438306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438295#post1438295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The definition of torture on Wikipedia also excludes waterboarding as torture, imprisonment, psychological torture, and the whole....burning people alive thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's so weird to me that so many people don't consider waterboarding to be torture. It took Bill Maher <i>actually being waterboarded himself</i> for him to change his mind about it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T08:19:52-08:00","id":1438314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438295#post1438295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... the vast amount of horrors done by the organization were done during his fifteen year reign as Grand Inquisitor.</div> </div> </div> </div>2000 or so across 15 years comes out to more than 133 a year or more than 2 a week. <br /> <br /> At what point did it become a purely murderous social institution, some cruel and evil and acceptable part of the community. When did it become just a fact of life? And it would always have been a way for the already powerful to enforce that power over people with out power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T08:39:39-08:00","id":1438321,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grumpy RPG Reviews</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438314#post1438314\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 2000 or so across 15 years comes out to more than 133 a year or more than 2 a week.<br /> <br /> At what point did it become a purely murderous social institution, some cruel and evil and acceptable part of the community. When did it become just a fact of life? And it would always have been a way for the already powerful to enforce that power over people with out power.</div> </div> </div> </div>Given it was considered monstrous at the time and the murders it committed against innocent people (again, AT THE TIME) I don't see how we're not engaging in horrific activity by saying the guy killing vast numbers of people for a nonsensical conspiracy theory is a weird place to make a defense. Also, Torequemada was NOT an agent of a vast bureaucracy but the guy who signed off on these himself. The Spanish Inquisition was not a huge faceless bureaucracy driven by a bunch of Papal decrees but a relatively small band of 100 people.<br /> <br /> So, each of those 2000 people are 20 people killed each (all supervised by one man who appointed them) and all of them were vicious anti-Semites.<br /> <br /> A man who personally orders the death of 2000 people on the suspicion they MIGHT still be practicing Jews is a monster.<br /> <br /> It should be noted that this was also his idea and paranoid suspicion to begin with.<br /> <br /> But that's just my take.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> I actually will point out it's interesting which is worse, the fact the Inquisition carried out methodical and researched persecutions for killing innocent people over a long lengthy process or the witch burning lynch mobs that killed 40K around the same time but were done in the heat of the moment.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-06-2021, 11:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T08:57:50-08:00","id":1438326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438196#post1438196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ironic... and very annoying for those of us Catholics who'd like to see a legit Catholic hunter organization presented in media somewhere. Because &quot;fanatical evil Catholics who are worse than the monsters if they aren't actually in league with the Devil and the Pope is the Antichrist&quot; gets old after the first hundred or so times you see it in media.</div> </div> </div> </div>Have you come across the late 90's British TV series <a href=\"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt0169501/?ref_=nv_sr_srsg_5\" target=\"_blank\">Ultraviolet</a>, it fits the bill, and also thinking about it could be a good base for how the SI works in part.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26145-babi_gog","name":"babi_gog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T11:40:37-08:00","id":1438344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438321#post1438321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Given it was considered monstrous at the time and the murders it committed against innocent people (again, AT THE TIME) I don't see how we're not engaging in horrific activity by saying the guy killing vast numbers of people for a nonsensical conspiracy theory is a weird place to make a defense. Also, Torequemada was NOT an agent of a vast bureaucracy but the guy who signed off on these himself. The Spanish Inquisition was not a huge faceless bureaucracy driven by a bunch of Papal decrees but a relatively small band of 100 people.<br /> <br /> So, each of those 2000 people are 20 people killed each (all supervised by one man who appointed them) and all of them were vicious anti-Semites.<br /> <br /> A man who personally orders the death of 2000 people on the suspicion they MIGHT still be practicing Jews is a monster.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>You sure those 2000 deaths are all Jews (or, if you've been paying attention, Jews claiming to be christian for legal reasons, because the Inquisition left jews claiming to be jews alone)? As I've said, the Inquisition also targeted rapists, child abusers... people that may, in the context of a society with capital punishment, deserve capital punishment. I've not gone into detailed analysis and can't assure you that those 2000 folks were guilty rapists rather than Innocent Jews who weren't pretending to be catholic to cheat unfair taxes, but I really think it should be considered that you're just assuming the worst to suit the narrative you like best. You should also consider that, well, people at the time have their political ambitions and biases. Even Popes aren't above attacking political enemies. Again, the Inquisition, even under Nazi McBrutal, only executed a very small number of the people they prosecuted. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I actually will point out it's interesting which is worse, the fact the Inquisition carried out methodical and researched persecutions for killing innocent people over a long lengthy process or the witch burning lynch mobs that killed 40K around the same time but were done in the heat of the moment. </div> </div> </div>In a town I lived for a while, there was a small monument to the witch burnings that occured there; A high number, but it also gave a time-frame for these killings, and it gave a really big timeframe.<br /> Understanding that most of the time, getting killed for witchcraft didn't mean people thought you had a pointy hat, but rather that you've done and poisoned your husband...<br /> Maybe it's the numbing effect of statistics, but really, the burning of witches isn't the most heinous crime-against-women we'd like to imagine, at least in most cases.<br /> <br /> I don't know how heavily taxed Jews were in spain. However, such laws were decided by the state, not the church and the inquisition. While the rules may not have been fair, It's hard to go as far and describe someone dodging taxes as innocent.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 03-06-2021, 02:42 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T11:58:09-08:00","id":1438346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438344#post1438344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You sure those 2000 deaths are all Jews (or, if you've been paying attention, Jews claiming to be christian for legal reasons, because the Inquisition left jews claiming to be jews alone)? As I've said, the Inquisition also targeted rapists, child abusers... people that may, in the context of a society with capital punishment, deserve capital punishment. I've not gone into detailed analysis and can't assure you that those 2000 folks were guilty rapists rather than Innocent Jews who weren't pretending to be catholic to cheat unfair taxes, but I really think it should be considered that you're just assuming the worst to suit the narrative you like best. You should also consider that, well, people at the time have their political ambitions and biases. Even Popes aren't above attacking political enemies. Again, the Inquisition, even under Nazi McBrutal, only executed a very small number of the people they prosecuted.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're misunderstanding the purpose of the Spanish Inquisition, which was Torquemada's issue with the existence of &quot;Secret Jews&quot; that is basically something that he came up with as the belief that the people who converted to Christianity on pain of exile or death were carrying on their religion in secret. It was a conspiracy theory. IT was the vast bulk of his vitims and helped lay the groundwork for the belief in Judaism not as a religion but as an ethnic group that could never be assimilated.<br /> <br /> Part of the motivation here is the fact that Torquemada was ethnically Jewish himself and clearly overcompensating for his own perceived status.<br /> <br /> But we're off topic and I'll say no more.<br /> <br /> ONTO SECOND INQUISITION<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T13:40:34-08:00","id":1438350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438346#post1438346\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You're misunderstanding the purpose of the Spanish Inquisition, which was Torquemada's issue with the existence of &quot;Secret Jews&quot; that is basically something that he came up with as the belief that the people who converted to Christianity on pain of exile or death were carrying on their religion in secret.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, I looked up some different stuff; I wasn't getting the whole picture. While the inquisition didn't touch Jews proclaiming to be Jewish, the state itself wanted Jews to convert or exile (and Torquemada encouraged the state to make such laws which weren't repealed for a long time) <br /> <br /> Still, nice to everybody else* <br /> (shoot me now) <br /> *A few notable exceptions. <br /> <br /> People can be really selective with their rabid, unreasonable hatred. The Second inquisition can genuinely just hate vampires whilst having otherwise humanitarian ambition. <br /> Ghouls need help, and the pragmatic may note they make great sources of information, and a pragmatist may take advantage of their addiction... <br /> <br /> just going full 40k inquisition doesn't fucking work in modern society. We're not at that level of Dark in the World of Darkness (but also, the Inquisition in 40k mostly wants to save humanity.)<br /> <br /> I like my society of leopold as slightly unhinged, but passably sane at a cursory glance. Zealous, but responsible. Passionate but professional. A few might get boners murdering vampires, but those boners come from doing the lord's work. They blend old knowledge with modern methods; They can do all the high-end spy stuff and have good connections, and thus I don't really need another organization of highly skilled hunters to really overshadow them. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T13:55:43-08:00","id":1438353,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438289#post1438289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">With all that under consideration, why wouldn't the Second Inquisition be trying to better the world with their vampire hunts?</div> </div> </div> </div>The point of my original post is the worst atrocities in human history occurred precisely because someone believed they were <i>right</i>, were doing <i>good</i>, and that the ends however objectively horrific justified the means.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T13:59:49-08:00","id":1438355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438350#post1438350\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, I looked up some different stuff; I wasn't getting the whole picture. While the inquisition didn't touch Jews proclaiming to be Jewish, the state itself wanted Jews to convert or exile (and Torquemada encouraged the state to make such laws which weren't repealed for a long time</div> </div> </div> </div>Like I said, I actually draw a distinction between the Papal Inquisition and Spanish Inquisition but that's just me.<br /> <br /> Fun fact:<br /> <br /> I actually tend to make the Society of Leopold one of the more benevolent organizations in my setting. I've shared that I love making Van Helsing Hate Crimes Hunters in my games. I have plenty who are complete scumbags and monsters but I actually generally make the Society of Leopold Lawful Good with a bunch of Lawful Neutral rather than Lawful Evil torture prone psychos.<br /> <br /> This is because the Society of Leopold actually is one of those organizations that I rule genuinely gets patronage from the divine (or something very similar to it) in their setting. It is a harsh, rigid, and inflexible interpretation of Catholicism but it is not without mercy. If you have True Faith then you kind of have to maintain a High Humanity. The torture and murder prone Inquisitors are best thought of as Fallen Inquisitors.<br /> <br /> Sullivan Dane is pretty similar to how I like my Inquisitors. He's an ultra-serious, not particularly social man, and you wouldn't invite him to a party. He only drinks water with Grape Soda considered to be one of his personal indulgences. Dude has no interest in women (or men). Elvis sounds sinful to him. However, Sullivan is genuinely out there to protect the innocent and while he thinks all vampires are a threat to the living, he's pretty much kept busy going after the worst of them.<br /> <br /> I actually have a couple of adventure hooks about the fact that Sullivan is NOT happy with the Second Inquisition as he predicts (correctly) that the government will give them all the money and guns they want but it will correct their &quot;sacred purpose&quot; with their own agenda. They will become less about protecting the innocent and more about killing as many vampires as possible. The current Inquisitior General being someone with no True Faith because she's down with results over goodness.<br /> <br /> Sullivan would not be the first Inquisitor martyred by their own side either.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-06-2021, 05:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T14:01:29-08:00","id":1438356,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Theodrim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438353#post1438353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The point of my original post is the worst atrocities in human history occurred precisely because someone believed they were <i>right</i>, were doing <i>good</i>, and that the ends however objectively horrific justified the means.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's the Trolley problem.<br /> <br /> &quot;Which would an Inquisitor do?&quot;<br /> <br /> A. Kill a vampire by burning down a house (or even apartment building) with a family inside that they live underneath.<br /> <br /> B. Let the vampire go to (possibly) kill again.<br /> <br /> I prefer Inquisitors who are happy to do A because it's a shitty-shitty world. I just weirdly don't do that with the Society of Leopold who you'd think WOULD be a bunch of torture-prone assholes but usually aren't.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T14:25:14-08:00","id":1438358,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438356#post1438356\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I prefer Inquisitors who are happy to do A because it's a shitty-shitty world. I just weirdly don't do that with the Society of Leopold who you'd think WOULD be a bunch of torture-prone assholes but usually aren't.</div> </div> </div> </div>I tend to play Inquisitors on the batshit end of the spectrum and don't provide much middle ground on the subject, because I don't see how nominally high Humanity characters would associate with them willingly while preserving their Humanity. But on the other hand, I don't restrict Faith behind Humanity rating for mortals and treat it as any other available Numina. I simply don't see a reason for a low-Humanity zealot bastard to be unable to manifest their &quot;faith&quot; as such in a universe in which other, less metaphysically staunch mortals, can pull summoned gubbins out their butts, chuck fireballs, or teleport about practically at will.<br /> <br /> And, the high Humanity ones don't &quot;hunt&quot; as such. They're going to take their time, investigate, figure out the inner workings of their &quot;targets&quot;, and do their best to foil the <i>truly</i> monstrous ones' plans as best they can without racking up a death toll. A city's Diocese, various (genuine) charitable organizations, or something like a whisper network of former ghouls, can wreak Hell on a vampiric population in ways that don't involve bodies hitting the ground. <i>Those</i> are the ones I make capable of performing Miracles, as opposed to the former.<br /> <br /> Which I suppose is a bigger, more structural, problem with how hunters are represented and treated in the game. Whole lotta ink spilled over <i>killing</i> vampires, not a lot spilled over <i>mitigating their influence</i>.<br /> <br /> In terms of the HtR spectrum, on one end are the Waywards, Avengers, and Defenders. On the other are the Martyrs, Innocents, Redeemers, and Judges. One group believes they're firmly in the right and the ends justify the means, the others are quite a bit more introspective and circumspect.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":431,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","user":"Theodrim","date":". 03-06-2021, 05:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T14:57:29-08:00","id":1438364,"title":"","content":"I play hunters as all sorts of people. But the stupid die first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T15:00:23-08:00","id":1438365,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438364#post1438364\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I play hunters as all sorts of people. But the stupid die first.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the biggest thing to remember about the Society of Leopold is they probably know everything in the rule book about vampires.<br /> <br /> It's just they don't care.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, yes, you're an 7th generation member of Clan Ventrue. The grandchilde of Hardelstadt. That just means use more explosives due to the durability of your line.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-06T16:50:13-08:00","id":1438396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438321#post1438321\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Given it was considered monstrous at the time...</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not going to get into a debate over the man, though to be specific I think he was a monster. My point was that the evil he did became a part of Spanish society at the time and went on for the better part of two decades. In the World of Darkness it was probably crawling with Lasombra who did not create it, but did make it worse.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-07T11:49:34-08:00","id":1438486,"title":"","content":"To switch topics:<br /> <br /> I think one of the interesting things to speculate regarding the Second Inquisition is the logistics of the organization and whether it's rising or falling as a group by the time the campaign has started for 5th Edition.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/BrokeYourArmPunchingOutCthulhu\" target=\"_blank\">https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.p...hingOutCthulhu</a><br /> <br /> Basically, the question is whether or not the Second Inquisition's victories have emboldened them or exhausted them and that's going to determine the best way to use the organization from then on in your campaign.<br /> <br /> The books don't say it so it's up to the ST whether:<br /> <br /> 1. <b>Exhausted</b>: The attack on the Tremere Chantry took every bit of their resources, influences, and probably direct manpower to pull off. Even if you think they never should have pulled it off and needed an inside man, it's possible that such a victory resulted in the SI finally being taken seriously. The Camarilla and other forces could then launch their own counterattack on the agencies themselves let alone the people inside them to severely undermine or possibly even co-opt the group. London becomes the last city to fall or even any further cities that do fall are because they're being led around like a mouse in a maze to their eventual destruction.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>Emboldened</b>: The Second Inquisition is an existential threat to Kindred as a whole. Kindred are coming together in larger cities because whole other cities are being wiped clean out. The Beckoning has gotten rid of the Ancients so the SI is able to handle the younger ones. If they don't find out a solution then vampires may be wiped off the face of the Earth completely someday.<br /> <br /> (Yay?)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-07T14:26:50-08:00","id":1438500,"title":"","content":"I still hold on to the -grand conspiracy- prospect. <br /> <br /> The Beckoning, the shrinking of the Camarilla, and the disappearance of the Sabbat are all to set the stage for the Second Inquisition. <br /> Too many Neonates. Too many 'liberals'. The fear of masquerade breaches was getting to an all-time high. And so the inner-circle of the cam, who are secretly buddy-buddy with the higher ups of the Sabbat (Cardinals? What're they called?) and no doubt some shadowy methuselah have aranged to massacre most of the neonates and &quot;set the slate clean&quot;. The Beckoning is really a method to remove the dissenters (or vampires are leaving for their own safety because they know shit's going down) and the Gehenna war's a death trap. <br /> <br /> Once the 'problem children' have been dealt with (survivors are worthy) The Cam will perhaps begin embracing again, encouraging stricter standards, and will retake the barren anarch territories. After killing off the diehards, The surviving elder Sabbat who mostly used religion and antedeluvian fears to control the masses mostly won't mind filtering into the Camarilla. <br /> <br /> And then there will be order again. <br /> <br /> Now of course, this isn't going to go as well as planned, but it'll mostly work. What this means for the SI is that, well, it's not an impossible coalition of rogue agents who've somehow connected to rogue agents of other agencies, we have vampires all starting local-ish hunter groups at the same time, and we have a lot of misinformation thrown around to get it to work. We're mostly talking discharged agents and false agencies masquerading as real agencies with their unwitting dupes (a strategy often employed by those in corporate espionage; &quot;I'm with the Federal police, we want you spy on your boss for your country&quot;), Add in some mercenaries, militia-cults, hunter organization turncoats and homegrown, vampire trained, brainwashed hunters and you've got yourself a frightful 'inquisition. <br /> Best part is, with disciplines being what they are, and vampires being what they are, if someone gets caught making their own hunter group, people'll just assume that they're taking advantage of the chaos, not that this is happening everywhere and the chaos was entirely constructed by vampires on the local level. It's not that hard to plant evidence of a genuine arcanum-SoL-BigGov involvment in any case.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T03:42:03-08:00","id":1439418,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1438365#post1438365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think the biggest thing to remember about the Society of Leopold is they probably know everything in the rule book about vampires.<br /> <br /> It's just they don't care.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, yes, you're an 7th generation member of Clan Ventrue. The grandchilde of Hardelstadt. That just means use more explosives due to the durability of your line.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Or use fire, the great equalizer of WoD<br /> <br /> EDIT: I was just watching some YouTube material on flamethrowers, and I was wondering, how often does the SI use fire tactics? Incendiary grenades would be an obvious inclusion. Flamethrowers require large tanks to be used for more than seconds at a time, and would therefore require a vehicle carrying a armored container filed with petrol. Inclusion of Thermite seems sound although I don't know how you would accurately include that in a game as I'm no expert in the matter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","user":"AscentionTheMage","date":". 03-12-2021, 08:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-12T16:43:38-08:00","id":1439538,"title":"","content":"I'm about to run <i>Innocence in Blood</i> and I think I'm going to run the<b> Cult of Eligos</b> as a substitute for the Ministry. I absolutely love that group and think it's pretty representative of &quot;The Second Inqusition run amuck.&quot; The idea that its members would try to recruit vampires as weapons because it's leaders are already high on the power and benefits of being cult leaders.<br /> <br /> Anyone else love the Cult of Eligos?<br /> <br /> They may be my favorite part of the Cults of the Blood Gods supplement.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T03:27:07-08:00","id":1439624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1439418#post1439418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Or use fire, the great equalizer of WoD<br /> <br /> EDIT: I was just watching some YouTube material on flamethrowers, and I was wondering, how often does the SI use fire tactics? Incendiary grenades would be an obvious inclusion. Flamethrowers require large tanks to be used for more than seconds at a time, and would therefore require a vehicle carrying a armored container filed with petrol. Inclusion of Thermite seems sound although I don't know how you would accurately include that in a game as I'm no expert in the matter.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Post-ww1 Man-portable flamethrowers are actually really impressive. Don't be so hard on them. A backpack is more than enough for a nest of vampires. <br /> Dragonsbreath rounds are a novelty; the burning stuff in them is light and small and completely loses the power of the shotgun. They'd provoke a fear-frenzy, but they're not that effective in killing vampires themselves. <br /> Incendiary rounds are like... actual -I want to start fires- Incendiary rounds are generally only found for big bullets, like .50 BMG and above. If you're using .50 BMG and above, you don't need incendiary rounds to kill vampires. They're paste. If you wanted fire-bullets in an ordinary assault rifle, you're outa luck. <br /> Thermite was listed for soaking fire pre-v5. I think, like Incendiary rounds, the kind of weapons you'd use to launch thermite are going to be big weapons that don't need it. I'm not an expert though. You could certainly have good, pulpy fun by pouring it over a sleeping vampire. <br /> <br /> Flaming spears might be a good way to -herd- a vampire to capture it, but for killing one, a flamethrower would be better. <br /> Fire arrows, IRL, were garbage for killing people. You basically sacrificed a weighted pointy end and aerodynamics to get the fire, and There was like a 1% chance you'll start a fire using them, and you made up for that by shooting a lot of them at once. Maybe modern materials might make up for the shortcommings of historical items, but you'd be better off using a flamethrower or AM rifle. <br /> <br /> I would stick to flamethrowers and explosives, or fluids/gas traps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-13T07:55:20-08:00","id":1439654,"title":"","content":"In the TV show version of Highlander, the Hunters had a somewhat decent strategy for dealing with Immortals.<br /> <br /> * Shoot them a lot<br /> * Cut off their head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-14T17:05:35-07:00","id":1439944,"title":"","content":"Heck, I've played plenty of vampires who use that same strategy for killing other vampires. Well, maybe with a &quot;commit diablerie&quot; buried somewhere in those steps, depending on the campaign. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-14T18:47:16-07:00","id":1439956,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1439418#post1439418\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Or use fire, the great equalizer of WoD</div> </div> </div> </div>Not so much, in this post-Master of Fire world. You try to burn werewolves, and they regenerate from it just as fast... and it's in-type for the most populous breed of them, too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-15T08:05:24-07:00","id":1440030,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1439624#post1439624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Post-ww1 Man-portable flamethrowers are actually really impressive. Don't be so hard on them. A backpack is more than enough for a nest of vampires. <br /> Dragonsbreath rounds are a novelty; the burning stuff in them is light and small and completely loses the power of the shotgun. They'd provoke a fear-frenzy, but they're not that effective in killing vampires themselves. <br /> Incendiary rounds are like... actual -I want to start fires- Incendiary rounds are generally only found for big bullets, like .50 BMG and above. If you're using .50 BMG and above, you don't need incendiary rounds to kill vampires. They're paste. If you wanted fire-bullets in an ordinary assault rifle, you're outa luck. <br /> Thermite was listed for soaking fire pre-v5. I think, like Incendiary rounds, the kind of weapons you'd use to launch thermite are going to be big weapons that don't need it. I'm not an expert though. You could certainly have good, pulpy fun by pouring it over a sleeping vampire. <br /> <br /> Flaming spears might be a good way to -herd- a vampire to capture it, but for killing one, a flamethrower would be better. <br /> Fire arrows, IRL, were garbage for killing people. You basically sacrificed a weighted pointy end and aerodynamics to get the fire, and There was like a 1% chance you'll start a fire using them, and you made up for that by shooting a lot of them at once. Maybe modern materials might make up for the shortcommings of historical items, but you'd be better off using a flamethrower or AM rifle. <br /> <br /> I would stick to flamethrowers and explosives, or fluids/gas traps.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's gonna come a time where the SI faces off against a methusala, at that point, they're going to need incindeary rounds.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-15T08:28:43-07:00","id":1440033,"title":"","content":"Taking military weapon stats from Mage, RAW, you won't need incendiary rounds for methuselah. a .50 bmg does 16 base damage, a 30mm cannon does 16 base damage and halves enemy soak. 'artillery' as vague as that is, does 30 base damage. we don't have stats for a modern MBT cannon, but I don't think a Gangrel Methuselah could soak it. Much less vampires that don't have so many advantages in Fortitude, nevermind Protean. 20mm cannons come in convenient man-sized sniper forms you can carry around, if you're interested.<br /> <br /> Another potential problem:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Trials conducted by </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forsvarets_Forskningsinstitutt\" target=\"_blank\">Forsvarets Forskningsinstitutt</a><span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (Norwegian Defence Research Establishment) have concluded that the ammunition most likely does not have an unlawful effect if unintentionally used against personnel, as the round will have penetrated the body and exited on the other side before the explosive and incendiary components of the round are initiated<br /> <br /> Might actually be great against the tanky Gangrel meth, but against a squishy malkavian, you might let the vampire live by focusing on an expensive, explosive bullet rather than just sheer volume and mass. A incendiary 50.bmg costs $65, a regular BMG costs $5. Maybe if you're hunting methuselah, money is no object, but you should also consider that vampires might have people monitoring the movement of incendiaries.<br /> <br /> From your posts, you seem to be going with a go-big approach. Maybe if you were really bothering to be covert, an incendiary might be worthwhile in some situations... but you'd be better off going with a bomb than a shot. Much more explainable. They don't normally bring in gunships for fighting terrorists, right? </span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 03-15-2021, 11:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-15T14:17:05-07:00","id":1440107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440033#post1440033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Taking military weapon stats from Mage</div> </div> </div> </div>I wouldn't. They're kind of weird, with the .50 BMG doing more damage than a 30mm. The former can be held in the hand of an adult, and plink off of most tank armor; the latter are larger than the hand of an adult, and will go through the sides of a tank. Maybe they transposed the numbers?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> RAW, you won't need incendiary rounds for methuselah. a .50 bmg does 16 base damage, a 30mm cannon does 16 base damage and halves enemy soak. 'artillery' as vague as that is, does 30 base damage. we don't have stats for a modern MBT cannon, but I don't think a Gangrel Methuselah could soak it. Much less vampires that don't have so many advantages in Fortitude, nevermind Protean. 20mm cannons come in convenient man-sized sniper forms you can carry around, if you're interested. </div> </div> </div>According to older heavy weapons stats, the main gun of a modern MBT does 30 dice. A heretical revision for all this, however, exists in the form of the non-canonical Exalted vs. WoD fan web supplement, which pares the numbers down. Also, you'd need some mad Potence to carry around a Vulcan cannon, not just for the weapon and ammo, but also for the batteries or other power source. Electric gatlings are power hogs.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Another potential problem:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Trials conducted by </span></span></span><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forsvarets_Forskningsinstitutt\" target=\"_blank\">Forsvarets Forskningsinstitutt</a><span style=\"color:#202122\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (Norwegian Defence Research Establishment) have concluded that the ammunition most likely does not have an unlawful effect if unintentionally used against personnel, as the round will have penetrated the body and exited on the other side before the explosive and incendiary components of the round are initiated<br /> <br /> Might actually be great against the tanky Gangrel meth, but against a squishy malkavian, you might let the vampire live by focusing on an expensive, explosive bullet rather than just sheer volume and mass. A incendiary 50.bmg costs $65, a regular BMG costs $5. Maybe if you're hunting methuselah, money is no object, but you should also consider that vampires might have people monitoring the movement of incendiaries.<br /> <br /> From your posts, you seem to be going with a go-big approach. Maybe if you were really bothering to be covert, an incendiary might be worthwhile in some situations... but you'd be better off going with a bomb than a shot. Much more explainable. They don't normally bring in gunships for fighting terrorists, right? </span></span></span> </div> </div> </div>One suspects that Plot Device Fortitude might be responsible for the capacity to tank nukes. The protection might be ablative, but it's probably there, given the grim tidings that the game wanted to present regarding the awakening of Zapathasura.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-15T21:21:52-07:00","id":1440139,"title":"","content":"It just occured to me, the SoL sourcebook mentions certain inquisitors have access to contreversial christian magic which, amoung other things, allows you to cast fireball, seeing how SoL has apperantly been absorbed into the SI, it stands to reason these magicions might make apperances in SI kill squads. There's also numia such as Pyroknesis and Hellfire, but it's not known what the SIs policy on psychics and sorcerers is.<br /> <br /> Another thing, what about Melle weapons, traditionally you kill vamps with decapitation, however, killing vampires with a shotgun blast to the head seems to imply that destroying the brain will also kill the vampire. I can think of a few recomendations however I've not seen the weapon charts so the weapon I have in my head might be trumped by something else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-15T22:27:10-07:00","id":1440140,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440139#post1440139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Another thing, what about Melle weapons, traditionally you kill vamps with decapitation, however, killing vampires with a shotgun blast to the head seems to imply that destroying the brain will also kill the vampire. I can think of a few recomendations however I've not seen the weapon charts so the weapon I have in my head might be trumped by something else.</div> </div> </div> </div>This was confirmed in VAMPIRE: THE MASQUERADE: WINTER'S TEETH as a mortician brain hammer is capable of killing a vampire as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-15T22:43:27-07:00","id":1440142,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440140#post1440140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This was confirmed in VAMPIRE: THE MASQUERADE: WINTER'S TEETH as a mortician brain hammer is capable of killing a vampire as well.</div> </div> </div> </div>A war pick is good for punching holes in skulls with insane levels of peircing power. axes are also good as a strike to the skull can penetrate the brain. There's also the custom armour killer made for skaligram that can split a cainites head in 2, and a Ikakalaka is apperantly good for decapitations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-15T23:01:30-07:00","id":1440145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440139#post1440139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It just occured to me, the SoL sourcebook mentions certain inquisitors have access to contreversial christian magic which, amoung other things, allows you to cast fireball, seeing how SoL has apperantly been absorbed into the SI, it stands to reason these magicions might make apperances in SI kill squads. There's also numia such as Pyroknesis and Hellfire, but it's not known what the SIs policy on psychics and sorcerers is.<br /> <br /> Another thing, what about Melle weapons, traditionally you kill vamps with decapitation, however, killing vampires with a shotgun blast to the head seems to imply that destroying the brain will also kill the vampire. I can think of a few recomendations however I've not seen the weapon charts so the weapon I have in my head might be trumped by something else.</div> </div> </div> </div>My view of the Second Inquisition is that it's dramatically increased its number of soldiers, funding, and access to military grade weapons plus has plenty of people willing to look the other way. However, its willingness to use Therugy and closeness with the government as well as hatred of the undead has had unintended consequences:<br /> <br /> * The number of True Faith members of the Inquisition is growing smaller.<br /> <br /> * The Inquisition also fought evil spirits, wraiths, werewolves, and actual demons as part of its duties. It's lately been 99% vampires and the organization is starting to feel like they're missing the forest for a particularly nasty set of trees. No Inquisitor thinks vampires aren't evil threats but generally they're considered to be by some to be the cockroach of the world versus the literal Hell Demons they have to deal with on a regular basis.<br /> <br /> * The new recruits are far less indoctrinated and pure in their faith than the normal hunters typically were. Being ex-Special Forces on a &quot;holy mission&quot; they're also more inclined to collateral damage.<br /> <br /> * The issue of Thin Bloods is dividing them since they seem to be alive and yet still bear the curse. Not all Inquisitors are 100% okay with their murder.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T02:23:54-07:00","id":1440169,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440145#post1440145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> My view of the Second Inquisition is that it's dramatically increased its number of soldiers, funding, and access to military grade weapons plus has plenty of people willing to look the other way. However, its willingness to use Therugy and closeness with the government as well as hatred of the undead has had unintended consequences:<br /> <br /> * The number of True Faith members of the Inquisition is growing smaller..</div> </div> </div> </div> don't see why it would. Radical haters have had true faith before, and Theurgy is not fundamentally at odds with faith. IRL the church used to condone hermeticism as a way of better understanding God's creation. <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The issue of Thin Bloods is dividing them since they seem to be alive and yet still bear the curse. Not all Inquisitors are 100% okay with their murder. </div> </div> </div> Nah, they'd think it fine. Angels are terrifying, but devils try to seduce. Its a vampire trick, and its not like thin bloods are especially common.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 03-16-2021, 05:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T04:10:31-07:00","id":1440175,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440169#post1440169\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> don't see why it would. Radical haters have had true faith before, and Theurgy is not fundamentally at odds with faith. IRL the church used to condone hermeticism as a way of better understanding God's creation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Generally because I stick strongly to High Humanity being required for True Faith.<br /> <br /> Hence why murdering Thin Bloods and other innocents removes it.<br /> <br /> I know plenty who treat it as purely a matter of belief, though.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T06:00:13-07:00","id":1440189,"title":"","content":"A certain Gargoyle serial killer comes to mind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T13:41:05-07:00","id":1440255,"title":"","content":"Which way to play True Faith is one of those \u201ctoolbox\u201d elements that can shape a campaign. For my own campaigns, I distinguish between Faith (basically super willpower) and True Faith (divine miracle-working).<br /> <br /> The former requires no particular level of Humanity, but is also limited in effect; it can force back vampires and resist their effects. The latter can also perform healing, blessing objects, exorcisms and wards against supernatural evil, but requires high Humanity and associated Virtues be maintained. <br /> <br /> Basically, those with Faith are the fanatics; those with True Faith are the saints. The former are common in the Society of Leopold, the latter are almost unheard of within its modern ranks (which is why my own campaign has the separate Order of St. Michael as the good-aligned counterpoint to SoL/SI).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T14:21:58-07:00","id":1440265,"title":"","content":"Thing is, God in the old testament is a monumental cunt more often than not. Flawed, often downright vile gods are a feature of most big mythologies. Do you really need to be a nice person to have faith in a not-nice god?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-16T14:23:27-07:00","id":1440266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440265#post1440265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thing is, God in the old testament is a monumental cunt more often than not. Flawed, often downright vile gods are a feature of most big mythologies. Do you really need to be a nice person to have faith in a not-nice god?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's essentially the vampire's argument about the Church. The question is whether you believe the opposite.<br /> <br /> For me, I like threading the needle that whether God did curse the vampires or is an enormous ass or not, the power to repel the undead is restricted to the genuinely good. Whether it's because the deity or magic only works on the people they're &quot;rewarding&quot; or not or if it comes from a place of pure good in the soul that is naturally repulsive to the undead.<br /> <br /> Which makes their damnation all the more meaningful and likely to piss them off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-17T08:02:21-07:00","id":1440357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440265#post1440265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thing is, God in the old testament is a monumental cunt more often than not. Flawed, often downright vile gods are a feature of most big mythologies. Do you really need to be a nice person to have faith in a not-nice god?</div> </div> </div> </div>In terms of VtM lore, and presuming the recounting in The Book of Nod is accurate, I think a lot depends on how much of the cursing was God and how much was Caine suffering a VERY botched Awakening due to Lilith\u2019s little blood ceremony.<br /> <br /> Because I think there\u2019s very strong evidence from the description that the angelic curses weren\u2019t... the angels were, in fact, manifestations of his own guilt by his Avatar in a botched Seeking (and might have even gone marauder... turning the curses levied in his Seeking into physical manifestations that could be passed to others). Vampirism became his paradigm and this was established so early that it remains a mythic thread to this day. This would also be why he could invent new disciplines and lay curses on his progeny... the first vampire isn\u2019t even really a vampire, but an immortal (possibly Marauder) Mage.<br /> <br /> If so, then, in accordance with the Wormwood ending in Gehenna, God only gave Caine immortality so he would have as much time as he needed to repent his sin. It was Caine who chose to undergo a dangerous magickal ritual to obtain power that made him a vampire and Caine who chose to inflict it upon others and those so inflicted chose to compound the sins by inflicting it on even more.<br /> <br /> God can\u2019t take away free will and still be a just God (and in V5 he has not unleashed the Flood 2.0 to wash away the vampires yet), but He could give the power of True Faith to mankind to help them resist the vampires.<br /> <br /> Something worth remembering too; at least from the Catholic perspective on biblical accuracy; is that while the books of the Bible are inerrant on matters of Faith, the events prior to Babylonian Exile are as much allegory as fact and were written by people who existed in the world and were products of their time and place.<br /> <br /> Thus, they have to be read in the context of those times and, by the standards of Mesopotamia c. 550 BC (when the majority of the Old Testament was assembled from fragments and oral traditions), the God presented within was pretty much as loving and merciful as people of that society could understand a divine being to be... certainly in contrast to the Babylonian creation myths which cited the origin of humanity as arising from the blood of demons and thus were only worthy of being slaves to the gods (and, by no coincidence, the Babylonian priest-king who was their representative on Earth).<br /> <br /> How much of the Bible stories you want to be literal and how much you want to be allegory for God\u2019s relationship with mankind in the fictional VtM universe is going to vary from Storyteller to Storyteller. More recent official material seems to lean more allegorical as the question of if Caine was really the first vampire or if the vampires even all share the same common origin is left more open, but I figure that\u2019s as much about leaving wiggle room for individual campaigns than a specific retcon.<br /> <br /> Regardless, the answer on the source and power of Faith is one that can be left to the individual campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-17T12:39:53-07:00","id":1440374,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440357#post1440357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In terms of VtM lore, and presuming the recounting in The Book of Nod is accurate, I think a lot depends on how much of the cursing was God and how much was Caine suffering a VERY botched Awakening due to Lilith\u2019s little blood ceremony.<br /> <br /> Because I think there\u2019s very strong evidence from the description that the angelic curses weren\u2019t... the angels were, in fact, manifestations of his own guilt by his Avatar in a botched Seeking (and might have even gone marauder... turning the curses levied in his Seeking into physical manifestations that could be passed to others). Vampirism became his paradigm and this was established so early that it remains a mythic thread to this day. This would also be why he could invent new disciplines and lay curses on his progeny... the first vampire isn\u2019t even really a vampire, but an immortal (possibly Marauder) Mage.<br /> (...)</div> </div> </div> </div>While this makes sense, I much prefer Vampirism to be a completely separate phenomenon, stemming from exceptional circumstances surrounding the first Vampires (or singular Vampire). It gives a pause to think that Vampires (Kindred) are truly undead persons powered by Vitae, who can equal or surpass the Mages in various ways while being completely independent of the seemingly all-encompassing foundations and assumptions that <i>Mage: the Ascension</i> stands on.<br /> The innate power and usefulness of Vitae, the benefits of undeath, the ease of Embracing, the Disciplines - it is inspiring that Vampirism and Magick are separate and different in the capabilities and potency that they give to a person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3254,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","user":"Muad'Dib","date":". 03-17-2021, 04:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3254-muad-dib","name":"Muad'Dib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3254_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2059"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-19T00:12:08-07:00","id":1440553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440357#post1440357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">God can\u2019t take away free will and still be a just God\u2026</div> </div> </div> </div>All that\u2019s assuming <i>people have</i> \u201cfree will\u201d; I haven\u2019t been convinced that\u2019s the case yet.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-19T00:39:30-07:00","id":1440559,"title":"","content":"Also, the Book of Nod's take on the subject is a bit more nuanced:<br /> <br /> * God curses Caine to drink blood and eat ashes, suffer burns from sunlight, and a few other things that is designed to make him remorseful.<br /> <br /> * Caine doubles down on being an asshole to spite God.<br /> <br /> * LILITH teaches Caine 9 different types of Hedge Magic.<br /> <br /> * Caine learns how to share his curse.<br /> <br /> * Caine sets himself up as a ruler over Abel's descendants and feeds off them to spite God.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-19T06:20:39-07:00","id":1440584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440553#post1440553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All that\u2019s assuming <i>people have</i> \u201cfree will\u201d; I haven\u2019t been convinced that\u2019s the case yet.</div> </div> </div> </div>If there\u2019s no free will, then why even bother sharing? Nothing you post will change the decisions made in any way if it\u2019s all predetermined chemical reactions with delusions of sapience.<br /> <br /> If there\u2019s no free will than I have no choice but to hold to my belief in free will.<br /> <br /> That said, the GAME operates on the presumption that free will exists or there would be nothing for the Beast to rage against; no dominate, presence or blood bonds that act to subvert it.<br /> <br /> To the topic at hand... Yeah, most of vampire history is basically vampires spiting God. The Church of Caine gloms onto various Gnostic heresies (side-bar: the Gnostics were absolutely the Scientologists of their day) and claims Caine basically diablerized Jesus and so is now the true God of the world. The Lasombra mock all things Catholic with their rituals and Abyss mysticism. How many have set themselves up as false gods?<br /> <br /> Is it any wonder the Catholic Church would seek to remove them since so much of vampire culture is, according to their faith, based on corrupting and subverting the wills of people and dragging them into sin?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-19T07:04:36-07:00","id":1440589,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440584#post1440584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there\u2019s no free will, then why even bother sharing?</div> </div> </div> </div>I couldn\u2019t have done it any other way.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440584#post1440584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nothing you post will change the decisions made in any way if it\u2019s all predetermined chemical reactions with delusions of sapience.</div> </div> </div> </div>To the contrary - if a chain of dominoes start tipping, the second-to-last one can still be said to have tipped the last one, <i>even if</i> the chain of predetermined physical actions leads back to the first domino being tipped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-19T15:44:50-07:00","id":1440654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440584#post1440584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there\u2019s no free will, then why even bother sharing? Nothing you post will change the decisions made in any way if it\u2019s all predetermined chemical reactions with delusions of sapience.</div> </div> </div> </div>The majority of cultures in history didn't believe in Free Will and the idea that you were predetermined to a specific course of action from birth.<br /> <br /> These didn't make them feel less important or meaningful in their relationships.<br /> <br /> Just fatalistic.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-19T15:48:50-07:00","id":1440655,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris24601</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1440584#post1440584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If there\u2019s no free will, then why even bother sharing? Nothing you post will change the decisions made in any way if it\u2019s all predetermined chemical reactions with delusions of sapience.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because the action of posting is part of the series of cause and effect relationships in question. You\u2019re confusing determinism and nihilism.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-19T18:54:41-07:00","id":1440671,"title":"","content":"Also, there's nothing about Dominate, the Beast, Presence, or Blood Bonds that necessitate a non-deterministic universe. That what's being called &quot;free will&quot; <i>even can</i> be subverted, to me is a pretty solid argument <i>against</i> it actually being, y'know, &quot;free.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-25T09:54:26-07:00","id":1441385,"title":"","content":"The government agencies know enough to make the supernatural creatures nervous, but not enough to blow the lid off the whole thing. They know that &quot;something weird is going on over there,&quot; but they can't just get on TV and say, &quot;There are vampires among us!&quot; <br /> At best, they'd be laughed at. At worst, they'd cause public disorder on a massive scale as folks went out to buy garlic and crucifixes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26415-cultofjimmy","name":"CultofJimmy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-25T11:22:31-07:00","id":1441396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CultofJimmy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441385#post1441385\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The government agencies know enough to make the supernatural creatures nervous, but not enough to blow the lid off the whole thing. They know that &quot;something weird is going on over there,&quot; but they can't just get on TV and say, &quot;There are vampires among us!&quot;<br /> At best, they'd be laughed at. At worst, they'd cause public disorder on a massive scale as folks went out to buy garlic and crucifixes.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's interesting that the government could indeed destroy the Masquerade tomorrow but they chose not to for possibly self-serving reasons. The idea that whatever the case when the Masquerade is broken, the society as we know it today would not be the society we knew tomorrow.<br /> <br /> For many government officials they THINK they're doing it to protect the many but there's also the fact that it very much could destroy their OWN power.<br /> <br /> &quot;Listen. Every week there's a panic about some puny little bug. Now how do you think it would be if this got out? Hm? You'll have paranoia, you'll have vigilantes, you'll have people running back to religion in droves. The next thing you know, you'll have the Archbishop up for Prime Minister. I don't fancy living in Iran, do you?&quot; - Vaughn, Ultraviolet<br /> <br /> Which I imagine is why the NSA and Society of Leopold won't be GOOD friends.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-25T11:31:36-07:00","id":1441398,"title":"","content":"Honestly the bigger surprise is that more in power aren't trying to blackmail vampires into making them immortal. The incredible temptation of immortality is something that doesn't come up nearly as much as it should in these games about humans discovering vampires. If vampires were discovered to be real tomorrow, the public wouldn't be scrambling to slaughter them, they'd be scrambling to steal their immortality. The headlines would be all about people demanding that the sick and old get first dibs, and plans for dealing with vampiric weaknesses and needs. The rich would immediately start circumventing efforts to prioritize the sick/old and make themselves the priority.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-25T12:13:39-07:00","id":1441406,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441398#post1441398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly the bigger surprise is that more in power aren't trying to blackmail vampires into making them immortal. The incredible temptation of immortality is something that doesn't come up nearly as much as it should in these games about humans discovering vampires. If vampires were discovered to be real tomorrow, the public wouldn't be scrambling to slaughter them, they'd be scrambling to steal their immortality. The headlines would be all about people demanding that the sick and old get first dibs, and plans for dealing with vampiric weaknesses and needs. The rich would immediately start circumventing efforts to prioritize the sick/old and make themselves the priority.</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably another reason not to let it out. It's also funnily the reason the Masquerade existed in my Red Room books.<br /> <br /> Not because of a panic but the fact that the protagonists thinks humans would fall over one another to offer up their neighbors to demons.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-25T13:45:52-07:00","id":1441416,"title":"","content":"It goes like this <br /> <br /> &quot;First minister, we just discovered your friend Jeff is a Vampire&quot; <br /> &quot;You mean the Jeff that pays for my more expensive dinners and who introduces me to forbidden pleasures, the same Jeff who got my kids into Eton and who gave my wife a Tesla model 3, the Jeff who funded my campaign to get elected, which in turn got you your appointment in your prestigious and well paying job? This Antique Mahogany desk right here? Jeff's doing. <br /> &quot;So you're saying...&quot;<br /> &quot;Do you want a paycut? You best un-discover Jeff as soon as goddamn possible&quot;<br /> &quot;right away, sir.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-25T15:58:32-07:00","id":1441427,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441416#post1441416\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It goes like this<br /> <br /> &quot;First minister, we just discovered your friend Jeff is a Vampire&quot;<br /> &quot;You mean the Jeff that pays for my more expensive dinners and who introduces me to forbidden pleasures, the same Jeff who got my kids into Eton and who gave my wife a Tesla model 3, the Jeff who funded my campaign to get elected, which in turn got you your appointment in your prestigious and well paying job? This Antique Mahogany desk right here? Jeff's doing.<br /> &quot;So you're saying...&quot;<br /> &quot;Do you want a paycut? You best un-discover Jeff as soon as goddamn possible&quot;<br /> &quot;right away, sir.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>In THE FALL OF LONDON, the book never outright says it but I believe is strongly implying that the sudden windfall of government support and lack of skepticism from the British government's bureaucrats as well as financiers is due to so many of them being secretly part of Mithras' (mortal) cult.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-25T18:02:02-07:00","id":1441441,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441427#post1441427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In THE FALL OF LONDON, the book never outright says it but I believe is strongly implying that the sudden windfall of government support and lack of skepticism from the British government's bureaucrats as well as financiers is due to so many of them being secretly part of Mithras' (mortal) cult.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's amusing to think of something like <i>Yes, Minister</i> or <i>The Thick of It</i> with vampires lurking about, making everything worse.<br /> <br /> In any case, one of the things which makes the SI relevant in most any game is the idea of some elder trying to use it as a weapon against his enemies, only for it to burn everyone involved. Further, a lot of mortals would want to pillage vampire accounts for the funds and would have no loyalty to any vampire trying to pay them off, even as they would take the money.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T03:39:59-07:00","id":1441482,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441427#post1441427\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In THE FALL OF LONDON, the book never outright says it but I believe is strongly implying that the sudden windfall of government support and lack of skepticism from the British government's bureaucrats as well as financiers is due to so many of them being secretly part of Mithras' (mortal) cult.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Tories have been in power for 10 years. At least half of them are Vampires in real life. <br /> If you've been paying even a slight bit of attention to British politics, it'd be very strange to hear that in the WoD, they've been purged of vampires, when in reality things have just being going from bad to worse. You'd think a good vampire cleansing would brighten things up, no? Lessen that corruption? Like, last I checked, the minister in charge of dealing with covid was handing contracts out to her friends, and the minister for anti-corruption hasn't said anything about it because... they're married. Oh, and that Grenfell* investigation has quietly faded into the background without finding anyone accountable in four years, and.... To say the vampires were purged... It's a good deal too much cognitive dissonance for me. <br /> <br /> *I think most would find it in poor taste to attach this tragedy to the Second inquisition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T04:03:33-07:00","id":1441483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441482#post1441482\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Tories have been in power for 10 years. At least half of them are Vampires in real life.<br /> If you've been paying even a slight bit of attention to British politics, it'd be very strange to hear that in the WoD, they've been purged of vampires, when in reality things have just being going from bad to worse. You'd think a good vampire cleansing would brighten things up, no? Lessen that corruption? Like, last I checked, the minister in charge of dealing with covid was handing contracts out to her friends, and the minister for anti-corruption hasn't said anything about it because... they're married. Oh, and that Grenfell* investigation has quietly faded into the background without finding anyone accountable in four years, and.... To say the vampires were purged... It's a good deal too much cognitive dissonance for me.<br /> <br /> *I think most would find it in poor taste to attach this tragedy to the Second inquisition.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Fall of London has a very &quot;you&quot; theory on it and basically is exactly what you came up with independently for the Fall of Vienna. The whole massacre of the vampires of London is nothing more than the will of Mithras and his cult to purge one of the largest most important cities in the world of undead that aren't loyal to their master. Once Mithras has reached full power as a 4th generation vampire, he'll sweep back into the city and make it the stronghold for his new sect.<br /> <br /> Whatever that will be.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-26T10:03:00-07:00","id":1441521,"title":"","content":"In terms of politics coming out of London, normal mortals can be venal, petty, corrupt, greedy, and mediocre all on their own.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T06:06:24-07:00","id":1441632,"title":"","content":"Well the fall of London also possible has the interesting bit in it from the history of the MI5, and especially Division Six, taken from Hunter First Contact<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">the head of Division Six the division that deals with the supernatural was being blackmailed by some vampires and thus working for them. This would lead nicely into the Mithras house cleaning of the events later in London I think.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26145-babi_gog","name":"babi_gog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T12:08:25-07:00","id":1441671,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441398#post1441398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honestly the bigger surprise is that more in power aren't trying to blackmail vampires into making them immortal. The incredible temptation of immortality is something that doesn't come up nearly as much as it should in these games about humans discovering vampires. If vampires were discovered to be real tomorrow, the public wouldn't be scrambling to slaughter them, they'd be scrambling to steal their immortality. The headlines would be all about people demanding that the sick and old get first dibs, and plans for dealing with vampiric weaknesses and needs. The rich would immediately start circumventing efforts to prioritize the sick/old and make themselves the priority.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I believe vampiric weaknesses are too crippling for this to become a likely scenario.<br /> <br /> I mean sure they will certainly be those who would try and they would not be insignificant, but not only I believe those that would try to torch them are more numerous, but they have a serious advantage with the &quot;I can't do anything for the whole day and sunrays kill me in seconds&quot; aspect.<br /> <br /> This is why vampires hide from human afterall. Not all of them are gifted with godly powers or generous DM's. Most are quite weak if attacked during the day. Secrecy is key to their survival. And wannabees are certainly going to be the first hunted and the weakest of the bunch especially if they are &quot;rich&quot; and &quot;famous&quot;.<br /> <br /> Ghouldom tough? If the Blood bond can be circumvented? That's an another story entirely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24936-morbus","name":"Morbus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T12:34:45-07:00","id":1441676,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morbus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441671#post1441671\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>I believe vampiric weaknesses are too crippling for this to become a likely scenario.</b><br /> <br /> I mean sure they will certainly be those who would try and they would not be insignificant, but not only I believe those that would try to torch them are more numerous, but they have a serious advantage with the &quot;I can't do anything for the whole day and sunrays kill me in seconds&quot; aspect.<br /> <br /> This is why vampires hide from human afterall. Not all of them are gifted with godly powers or generous DM's. Most are quite weak if attacked during the day. Secrecy is key to their survival. And wannabees are certainly going to be the first hunted and the weakest of the bunch especially if they are &quot;rich&quot; and &quot;famous&quot;.<br /> <br /> Ghouldom tough? If the Blood bond can be circumvented? That's an another story entirely.</div> </div> </div> </div>The gamelines have done a little with this already too.<br /> <br /> * There's a club in Washington D.C. where billionaires extend their lives with vampire blood as ghouls. They hunt smaller undead and basically have no difficulty draining them and eliminating them because of their resources.<br /> <br /> * The Ash cult of BLOOD CULTS indicates that young tech billionaires are finding Thin Bloods a much more agreeable form of undeath. Which could really change the power balance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T13:13:04-07:00","id":1441684,"title":"","content":"Blackmailing a vampire is stupid and not many are likely to try it. The vampire is just too unknown. You generally won't know what powers they have or even if the curse can be transmited, or if there's a difference between ghouling and being a full vampire (and a vampire may just convince you ghouls are just young vampires) <br /> The moment you get to the negotiating table you'll be dominated, or your friends will be dominated, or someone will follow them obfuscated or... their families become hostages. <br /> Even if you did get embraced (The vampire doesn't just drain you and leave you) you'll end up getting destroyed by a vampire society or, at the very least, get tricked into a full blood bond and used as fodder by a vampire that admires your guys.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T13:32:53-07:00","id":1441687,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441684#post1441684\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Blackmailing a vampire is stupid and not many are likely to try it.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's notably the plot of POWER PREY and the Chronicle is pretty clear, &quot;Yes, Redwood can cause a lot of damage and maybe even cause a few vampires to be destroyed but this will end badly for him in the end.&quot; There's even a Jigsaw-esque &quot;Murder Castle&quot; at the end of the game he tries to lure the vampires too with Hunters and it basically says that the PCs can just bypass it with their powers or thinking outside the box if they take a moment to do so.<br /> <br /> (one resolution is to just use Obfuscate to sneak in and murder the guy before trashing his computer)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T13:53:38-07:00","id":1441692,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441676#post1441676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* The Ash cult of BLOOD CULTS indicates that young tech billionaires are finding Thin Bloods a much more agreeable form of undeath. Which could really change the power balance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds really stupid. Aren't Thin Bloods supposed to be a 1/10 successful embrace? Especially for Daywalkers who are supposed to be 15th and 16th generations so embraced by another Thin Blood: ergo statistically suicide.<br /> <br /> <br /> Plus I can't see any upside for being Thin Blooded compared to being a Ghoul. You are just as fragile with all the bagage of being one of the damned. (like having a beast)<br /> <br /> Seems smarter to actually farm Thin Bloods since most of them can't blood bond. Yes it only works daily but it's a nice and safe supplement while hunting for better blood.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24936-morbus","name":"Morbus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T13:53:38-07:00","id":1441693,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441676#post1441676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">* The Ash cult of BLOOD CULTS indicates that young tech billionaires are finding Thin Bloods a much more agreeable form of undeath. Which could really change the power balance.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds really stupid. Aren't Thin Bloods supposed to be a 1/10 successful embrace? Especially for Daywalkers who are supposed to be 15th and 16th generations so embraced by another Thin Blood: ergo statistically suicide.<br /> <br /> <br /> Plus I can't see any upside for being Thin Blooded compared to being a Ghoul. You are just as fragile with all the bagage of being one of the damned. (like having a beast)<br /> <br /> Seems smarter to actually farm Thin Bloods since most of them can't blood bond. Yes it only works daily but it's a nice and safe supplement while hunting for better blood.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24936-morbus","name":"Morbus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T14:04:33-07:00","id":1441697,"title":"","content":"Pre V5 at least, 14th isn't nearly as bad as 1/10 (but is at most half successful) and 15th is... still not as bad as 1/10th successsful. 16th gens are births, not embraces, and are more ghoul than vampire. <br /> <br /> In V5, being a thin blood is an absolute disaster because you don't get powers outside of BS potion making but you can still only subside on blood. Thin bloods can't make ghouls in any edition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T14:10:43-07:00","id":1441700,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441697#post1441697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pre V5 at least, 14th isn't nearly as bad as 1/10 (but is at most half successful) and 15th is... still not as bad as 1/10th successsful. 16th gens are births, not embraces, and are more ghoul than vampire. <br /> <br /> In V5, being a thin blood is an absolute disaster because you don't get powers outside of BS potion making but you can still only subside on blood. Thin bloods can't make ghouls in any edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even the thin bloods who have sunlight resistance take agrivated damage when exposed to direct sunlight, they can only go out on cloudy days. Also thinblood offspring are weaker than Revenants, unless V5 makes Dhamphirs stronger. I always wonderer what happened when a thinblood impregnated another thinblood? Would the resulting Dhamphirs be stronger than Dhamphirs with one dusk parent and one human parent?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26433-ascentionthemage","name":"AscentionTheMage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26433_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-27T15:52:30-07:00","id":1441715,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Morbus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441692#post1441692\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Sounds really stupid. Aren't Thin Bloods supposed to be a 1/10 successful embrace?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's absolutely no sign of that from the way its presented in terms of fractions. It seems every 13th generation vampire is able to make them but 14th and 15th and 16th have difficulty doing it.<br /> <br /> Also, Thin Bloods are a HUGE rising number, which can't happen if that's remotely the fraction.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AscentionTheMage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441700#post1441700\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Even the thin bloods who have sunlight resistance take agrivated damage when exposed to direct sunlight, they can only go out on cloudy days. Also thinblood offspring are weaker than Revenants, unless V5 makes Dhamphirs stronger. I always wonderer what happened when a thinblood impregnated another thinblood? Would the resulting Dhamphirs be stronger than Dhamphirs with one dusk parent and one human parent?</div> </div> </div> </div>All of which I, myself, would take in exchange for:<br /> <br /> * Being awake during the day<br /> * Being permanently &quot;Blush of Life&quot; and effectively alive<br /> * Being able to eat food<br /> * Able to survive on Blood that would make most vampires sick.<br /> <b>* Immortality</b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 03-27-2021, 06:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-03-28T06:05:48-07:00","id":1441770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441715#post1441715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's absolutely no sign of that from the way its presented in terms of fractions. It seems every 13th generation vampire is able to make them but 14th and 15th and 16th have difficulty doing it.</div> </div> </div> </div>An interesting headcanon but I'll need some sources on 13th generation being all able to make thin bloods. As far as I know they can also (very rarely) make non thin blooded 14th generation or just botch the embrace. Embracing a thin blood is never a certainty, my odds are maybe off but the random factor is still cannon. So my point stands.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also, Thin Bloods are a HUGE rising number, which can't happen if that's remotely the fraction. </div> </div> </div>Why not? You just need to adjust the bodycount accordingly. If Thin Bloods are so huge in V5, I'd assume they would have adressed that issue. Because the reason why they are so few in V:TM is directly related to the fact that embracing one is by no means a certainty.<br /> <br /> And also them being so weak that any random human being can do God's work with a firearm.<br /> <br /> Or let the Sun do it. Because yes, not all thinbloods are immune to sunrays. It just take more seconds for them to be down.<br /> <br /> And I have not even touched on how &quot;young tech billionaire&quot; knows about vampirism and the different forms it can take. But since we are talking about V5, I will adjust my expectation accordingly and let this slide.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24936,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24936-morbus","user":"Morbus","date":". 03-28-2021, 09:10 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24936-morbus","name":"Morbus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"119"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T09:16:03-07:00","id":1445833,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1436617#post1436617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually they tried to make the Technocracy the Alt-Right a few years back in that Mage text game that was released alongside the even more cringy We Eat Blood VtM game.<br /> <br /> As I recall it was set in... Sweden I think, somewhere in Europe that was receiving a bunch of Middle Eastern refugees which the Technocracy was trying to stop because apparently non-white people are special or haven't had their Wonder crushed like White Europeans and Westerners have and can damage the local Paradigm they're trying to enforce. The amazing Double-Racism Combo of White People being Spiritually Damaged because of their culture while Non-White People are inherently special and spiritual because of their culture with cherry on top of the Technocracy being very blatantly the Alt-Right, never mind the YEARS of material to establish that the Technocracy would largely HATE those racist troglodytes.<br /> <br /> It was easily the dumbest way I've seen the Technocracy handled in an official WoD product. And I've read several of the early 1E books where they were treated in some truly bizarre and stupid ways.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes it whas Sweden and the Technocracy tried to stop that because they wanted to keep this superstitious people that all have still their nonsense believing in god out of Sweden which whas fine from the rational technocratic worldsight before and they want to stay it the same instead of having their to fight superstition again that will appear both in the refugees and the afraid swedens.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1441697#post1441697\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Pre V5 at least, 14th isn't nearly as bad as 1/10 (but is at most half successful) and 15th is... still not as bad as 1/10th successsful. 16th gens are births, not embraces, and are more ghoul than vampire. <br /> <br /> In V5, being a thin blood is an absolute disaster because you don't get powers outside of BS potion making but you can still only subside on blood. Thin bloods can't make ghouls in any edition.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope 16th Gen is Embrace too.<br /> Dhampir is created by procreation that can happen from 15th and 16th generation having sex.<br /> 14th Gens are normally embraced unless the 13th Gen is a Thinblood.<br /> Some 14th Gen has the bane Anemia which makes the success rate for embracing 15th Gen to only 20%.<br /> How likely it is Embracing 16th Gens is not documented but not better then 20%<br /> <br /> About the SI I think they are lead or at least in together with the Traditions and especially House of Hermes. Because in the crossover book it is said that the Hermetics believe that the Tremere are the leaders of the Camarilla because they where Mages before so it is only natural that the Tremere will lead the Vampires. That fits together with that the SI believes they have destroyed with Vienna the HQ of the Ivory Tower.<br /> About the Masquerade I think that right now it is even more important to stay Incognito because they are even taking every so small trace and unless you proof with actions that you are kind, harmless and want despite with your state to live with your friends and family and stay on the SI watchlist you will get destroyed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As I am from Austria I need to clarify two things.<br /> First my native language is german and so please point out if the english I write is broken so I can improve.<br /> Second I do not own VTMV beyond first three books nor any line after M20 Corebook because it is not out there and I wait for the translation.","edited":{"userid":26160,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","user":"Koronus","date":". 04-25-2021, 01:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26160-koronus","name":"Koronus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-25T11:31:14-07:00","id":1445849,"title":"","content":"The most recent entries on the Thin Bloods also seem to be that the Embraces do tend to succeed, they just take hours or even days to do so. So many of them get abandoned.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-04-26T08:50:35-07:00","id":1445977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1435985-on-the-subject-of-the-second-inquisition-the-masqurade?p=1445849#post1445849\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The most recent entries on the Thin Bloods also seem to be that the Embraces do tend to succeed, they just take hours or even days to do so. So many of them get abandoned.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes - and the success can be a surprise to all involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}